{"id":430,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自由と公正を土台に新しい紳士を育てる海城","feature_description":"海城は、自由を尊重しつつ公正さを大切にする「新しい紳士」の育成を教育目標に掲げています。中1・2で学習・生活習慣を整え、中3・高1で基礎学力を確立し、高2・3で進路に応じた学力完成を目指す三段階の教育です。受け身の学習から自ら学び取る姿勢へ移り、幅広い知識と他者への公正さを備えることを重視します。生徒の自由な選択と実行を教職員が柔軟に支援し、自由と公正を両立する姿勢を育てます。","clubs":[{"id":8009,"name":"中学野球部（軟式）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kaijo.ed.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8011,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kaijo.ed.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8012,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kaijo.ed.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8013,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kaijo.ed.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8014,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kaijo.ed.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8015,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kaijo.ed.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8016,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kaijo.ed.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8017,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kaijo.ed.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8018,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kaijo.ed.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8019,"name":"中学水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kaijo.ed.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8021,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kaijo.ed.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8028,"name":"地学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kaijo.ed.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8029,"name":"物理部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kaijo.ed.jp/school-life/club","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":8030,"na